            {
              "id": "GHSA-4xcv-9jjx-gfj3",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "GHSA-4xcv-9jjx-gfj3: Uncontrolled Resource Consumption"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/GHSA-4xcv-9jjx-gfj3?s=github&n=mem&t=npm&vr=%3C4.0.0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Versions of `mem` prior to 4.0.0 are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS).  The package fails to remove old values from the cache even after a value passes its `maxAge` property. This may allow attackers to exhaust the system's memory if they are able to abuse the application logging.\n\n\n## Recommendation\n\nUpgrade to version 4.0.0 or later.\n",
                "markdown": "> Versions of `mem` prior to 4.0.0 are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS).  The package fails to remove old values from the cache even after a value passes its `maxAge` property. This may allow attackers to exhaust the system's memory if they are able to abuse the application logging.\n\n\n## Recommendation\n\nUpgrade to version 4.0.0 or later.\n\n|                                                                                                  |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:npm/mem@1.1.0  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <4.0.0             |\n|Fixed version                                                                  4.0.0              |\n|[[CVSS Score 5.1] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:N]]                     |\n"
              },
