              "help": {
                "text": "Affected versions of `negotiator` are vulnerable to regular expression denial of service attacks, which trigger upon parsing a specially crafted `Accept-Language` header value.\n\n\n\n\n## Recommendation\n\nUpdate to version 0.6.1 or later.\n",
