            {
              "id": "CVE-2021-37712",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2021-37712: OWASP Top Ten 2017 Category A9 - Using Components with Known Vulnerabilities"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2021-37712?s=gitlab&n=tar&t=npm&vr=%3C%3D4.4.17",
              "help": {
                "text": "The npm package \"tar\" (aka node-tar) has an arbitrary file creation/overwrite and arbitrary code execution vulnerability. node-tar aims to guarantee that any file whose location would be modified by a symbolic link is not extracted. This is, in part, achieved by ensuring that extracted directories are not symlinks. Additionally, in order to prevent unnecessary stat calls to determine whether a given path is a directory, paths are cached when directories are created.\n",
                "markdown": "> The npm package \"tar\" (aka node-tar) has an arbitrary file creation/overwrite and arbitrary code execution vulnerability. node-tar aims to guarantee that any file whose location would be modified by a symbolic link is not extracted. This is, in part, achieved by ensuring that extracted directories are not symlinks. Additionally, in order to prevent unnecessary stat calls to determine whether a given path is a directory, paths are cached when directories are created.\n\n|                                                                                                      |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:npm/tar@2.2.1      |\n|Affected range                                                                 <=4.4.17               |\n|Fixed version                                                                  4.4.18, 5.0.10, 6.1.9  |\n|[[CVSS Score 8.6] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H]]                         |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">=3.0.0,<4.4.18",
                "cvssV3": 8.2,
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "cvssV3_vector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:N",
                "fixed_version": "4.4.18",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:npm/tar@2.2.1",
                  "pkg:npm/tar@4.4.4"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.2",
                "tags": [
                  "HIGH"
                ]
