            {
              "id": "CVE-2014-9390",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2014-9390: Improper Input Validation"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2014-9390?s=github&n=mercurial&t=pypi&vr=%3C3.2.3",
              "help": {
                "text": "Git before 1.8.5.6, 1.9.x before 1.9.5, 2.0.x before 2.0.5, 2.1.x before 2.1.4, and 2.2.x before 2.2.1 on Windows and OS X; Mercurial before 3.2.3 on Windows and OS X; Apple Xcode before 6.2 beta 3; mine; libgit2; Egit; and JGit allow remote Git servers to execute arbitrary commands via a tree containing a crafted .git/config file with (1) an ignorable Unicode codepoint, (2) a git~1/config representation, or (3) mixed case that is improperly handled on a case-insensitive filesystem.\n",
                "markdown": "> Git before 1.8.5.6, 1.9.x before 1.9.5, 2.0.x before 2.0.5, 2.1.x before 2.1.4, and 2.2.x before 2.2.1 on Windows and OS X; Mercurial before 3.2.3 on Windows and OS X; Apple Xcode before 6.2 beta 3; mine; libgit2; Egit; and JGit allow remote Git servers to execute arbitrary commands via a tree containing a crafted .git/config file with (1) an ignorable Unicode codepoint, (2) a git~1/config representation, or (3) mixed case that is improperly handled on a case-insensitive filesystem.\n\n|                                                                                                                            |\n|Package                                                                                           pkg:pypi/mercurial@3.1.2  |\n|Affected range                                                                                    <3.2.3                    |\n|Fixed version                                                                                     3.2.3                     |\n|[[CVSS Score 9.3] [CVSS Vector CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N]]                            |\n"
