                "markdown": "> Mercurial prior to 4.3 did not adequately sanitize hostnames passed to ssh, leading to possible shell-injection attacks.\n\n|                                                                                                                            |\n|Package                                                                                           pkg:pypi/mercurial@3.1.2  |\n|Affected range                                                                                    <4.3                      |\n|Fixed version                                                                                     4.3                       |\n|[[CVSS Score 9.3] [CVSS Vector CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N]]                            |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
